{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-04_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-04","title":"苦厄盤桓","storyCode":"13-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"90f825bbcb62d09e228ac4abfbe1dbb1623b541633caec557a2e621af4c2ae3a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你知道最殘忍的是什麼嗎？\n不是徹底的黑暗，無盡的折磨，或者一眼看不到頭的暗巷與其中藏匿的無數殺手。\n是你認定一切都已結束，所有的痛苦都終於迎來終結，那隻溫柔的手把你拉出了噩夢。\n然後，你突然發現，這場拯救，不過是個玩笑，不過是走入更黑暗處前的短暫喘息。\n更大的苦難，正抱著胳膊，在不遠處瞧著你。\n而你，卻無力回應這種嘲弄。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，你……想加入我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫德米爾公爵的靈柩正在運往前來增援的高速軍艦，一些難民很感激她，所以自發組織了護送靈柩離開的悼念儀式……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她一直看著她媽媽最後倒下的地方，儘管血跡早已清理乾淨。\n現在邀請她可能是個壞主意……\n我已經開始後悔了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜小姐，能替我感謝大家嗎？我……想在這再待一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那些人和你說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒什麼，只是希望我先留在這“冷靜一下”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍衛們登上了遲來的護航艦隊，他們大都……在其餘驚慌的貴族中保持了沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，一瞬間的破綻，因為我想去救那個士兵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔向我伸出了手，而無論這是不是一個顯而易見的陷阱，媽媽她……都因此受了傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陣型潰敗，人員傷亡，劍衛從不保護他們的公爵，劍衛只為完成他們的目標——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——但他們面對的敵人，還是強大得……超乎想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參謀們認為，這場冒進的行動有著太多的“私人感情”。參謀團本就……不會支持這樣的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……覺得……我是導致母親死亡的直接原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“英雄不該為軟弱之人殉葬。”他們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……說得沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看向那些遲來的戰艦，旗幟飄揚。\n毫無緣由地，我想到了阿勒黛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了，戴菲恩小姐。我盡量沖洗了下您的傷口，藥品有限，只能先這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也得告辭了，參謀團要求所有部隊都回去述職……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把一些屬於您的東西也一併留下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些本是公爵大人為您準備的禮物。當然，還有……她的配劍，您已經拿到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我接下來的話會稍顯冒昧，但我仍然希望，您能和我們一起回到“加拉瓦鐵盾”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論那些長官對您說了什麼，您依舊是“溫德米爾公爵”爵位的繼承人，任何人都無法改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會考慮的，但現在，請讓我獨自安靜一會吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們接走了一批人，但還有很多留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，呃，那位鐵血母親真的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……很諷刺，公爵把她的麾下培養得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕此刻，溫德米爾的參謀團依然在謀劃著吻合計劃的下一步行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這些功利的軍官老爺們似乎打算拋棄她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚，我甚至擔心……他們會對戴菲恩做什麼。她是“繼承人”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"繼承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她……還沒有準備好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溫德米爾公爵是鐵腕領袖。她的劍衛，她的參謀團，從來都只為維多利亞整體的利益考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她本人，卻因為女兒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做了一個值得欽佩，卻又實在太過莽撞的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這麼多人能活下來，不也因為這個決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有不尊重她的意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……這就意味著，戴菲恩會被溫德米爾公爵，她的母親，一手締造出的力量給拋棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們確實接走了一部分難民，難道我們真的能信他們？接下來的戰鬥跟著，呃，貴族混？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們沒有帶走所有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，就算人數眾多，既然這一艘船能裝得下，更多的高速戰艦沒道理——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼動靜？這艘船的動力艙不是毀了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看窗外！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剛與我們會合不久的護航艦隊，正揚起塵煙。\n它們正在駛離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她就那麼站在甲板上，她母親離世的地方。保持著我下去前的姿勢，抱著她母親的劍。\n風揚起她的短髮，孤獨使她顯得瘦小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我抓住她的肩膀，她這才回過頭來。\n沒有想像之中的惱怒，驚恐，悲傷，我甚至一時間看不出什麼……情感。\n唯有最平淡的失望，深邃到讓人焦躁不安的平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的語氣略帶顫抖。\n但還是——太平靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可下面還有想要趕去送別溫德米爾公爵靈柩的平民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那群混帳，他們就不怕誤傷無辜的人嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？怎麼回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這不符合軍令！或許只是他們收到的命令有誤……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船上還有幾輛能動的步兵戰車，我們需要盡快趕回“加拉瓦鐵盾”確認！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"呸。\n我第一次這麼認真地遠望著高速軍艦的艦尾。\n真滑稽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g10_wildbattlefield"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那場血雨在我們衣服上留下的痕跡依舊提醒著所有人那次殘酷的突襲。\n自我們離開溫德米爾公爵的旗艦，已經過了數個小時。\n壞消息接二連三，我們在撤下戰艦，清點人數的時候，發現……博士、阿米婭和阿斯卡綸不在他們之間。\n我們只來得及做一些簡單的搜索，但一無所獲……\n我只能相信他們的實力，但，阿米婭……不知為何，我總想起她瘦弱的肩膀。\n現在這支隊伍裡，“悲傷”或“無助”甚至成了最無暇被顧及的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別慢吞吞的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾伯特難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我真的走不動了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你非得讓我拿鞭子抽著你走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點！跑起來，想活就跟上前面的戰車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾伯特難民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……有點喘不上氣……長官，我生過病……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能再拖拖拉拉，這不光關係到你能不能活命——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開你的手，諾伯特區的混混，我只是在執行軍事命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們沒有經過和你們一樣的軍事訓練，連續五個小時的急行軍已經把他們榨乾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們大可就地躺下，留在這裡等死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是在救他們的命！只要回到“加拉瓦鐵盾”，一切就還有挽回的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們需要紮營休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都說了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不光是為了這些市民，也是為了你們，准尉。我知道你們的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被留下的士兵不多，但我很清楚，你們幾乎全都感染——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我只容忍你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是溫德米爾公爵下屬的軍人，別用你的行動玷污她的名號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“感染”，他們避之不及的詛咒。\n追上那艘拋棄他們的戰艦，掩蓋繃帶下日益凸起的黑色結晶。\n自欺欺人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……只是請別說出那個詞，該死的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好得很……我好得很！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要求過荒野行軍的時候保持低調，當心把那些薩卡茲部隊招惹過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天色已經暗下來了，跟著你們狂奔的那些普通人需要紮營休息，少尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……否決，繼續按照原定軍事任務正常行軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照這個速度，我們在午夜就能抵達31號高地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡我們就能和“加拉瓦鐵盾”恢復通訊，只有和移動要塞恢復聯繫了，這支隊伍才能真正安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果等到天亮，這支隊伍未必能在薩卡茲的部隊面前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這裡暫時的指揮官，你是船醫，也是這裡軍銜最高的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你應該很清楚，我們在靠步行和僅僅幾輛戰車，追趕高速戰艦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少尉，我尊重你的判斷，但我們甚至不知道那些高速軍艦到底為什麼離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些軍艦在當時沒有響應你們的通訊，你又憑什麼篤定，那座移動要塞會為我們敞開大門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經確認過隊伍裡的情況。目前為止，這支隊伍裡還有作戰能力的士兵只剩下不足三個連，還有大概近千名難民在跟著隊伍行進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你理想中的偉大行軍完成，還能跟上隊伍的人，不會超過百分之二十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫維娜，對吧。聽好了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的眼神在猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的百分之二十，是你的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於難民，全軍覆沒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官……（低語）。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不需要聽到他們說了什麼，我已經看見了所發生的事。\n沉默的人牆中，有人流乾了最後一滴血。\n他灑下的漫長血跡已經和泥漿攪在一起。\n少尉的沉默甚至沒有超過兩個呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微放慢速度……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們繼續行軍——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無藥可救。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的臉上留下我拳頭的紅印。\n我聽到了清脆的聲音，我想他下巴脫臼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他復原下巴的動作很利落，看來沒少處理這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在挑釁軍人，混混頭子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照維多利亞的軍事法，我可以處決你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘗試處決我，或者我們繼續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拳頭，這確實是只能偶爾為之的有效方法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"達格達，摩根和因陀羅站在了那些蠢蠢欲動的士兵之前。\n沉默的市民圍住了我們。\n這讓我想起來以前在街區搶地盤的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人不許妄動！不許誤傷平民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們叫你“推進之王”，是嗎？有些傳言，說你有什麼顯赫的身份……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個混混頭子。格拉斯哥幫的……老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我不在乎，但你聽好了，我是效忠於溫德米爾公爵的軍人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的使命就是完成長官交給我的任務！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我等你擦掉嘴角的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……放棄吧，你的手要脫臼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了保全大多數，我可以接受……犧牲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰是大多數？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真正睜眼看過你的隊伍嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"惶恐無措的士兵，沉默壓抑的市民，感染者，傷員。\n環繞著我們的，只是這麼一群人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想告訴他們，那些從諾伯特區的地獄爬出來的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們仍然有我罩著。還有人在乎他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拳頭大的人更有理，這是街頭的法則，少尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我現在告知你，他們會在這裡紮營休息整頓，我們必須重新考慮之後的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦與“加拉瓦鐵盾”的主力軍完全脫節，要是遇上薩卡茲的部隊，我們都會死，所有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希勒少尉，既然你還認可自己是溫德米爾公爵軍隊中的一員，那就別再給她丟臉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼可以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"戴菲恩握緊了劍柄。\n我很驚訝，但希勒少尉更加驚訝，驚訝之餘，還有惱怒。\n我突然想起來，在“加拉瓦鐵盾”棄我們而去之前，他其實是個會為艦上所有人提供醫療救助的軍醫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，這身衣服，那柄劍……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這身衣服……對於我還是有些太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我需要你們聽聽我的想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g10_wildbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少尉要出發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他們挑選了一輛狀態最好的戰車組建了特別小隊，他隨時可以出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這支小隊獨自輕裝疾行，預定會在天亮前抵達地圖上的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你穿上了這身衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……它所象徵的東西，也許還能幫上一些人的忙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，我已經和我的士兵們交代完畢。在我回來之前，這些士兵的指揮權暫時由您接管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我依舊想最後邀請您一次，您是溫德米爾公爵這個頭銜的第一順位繼承人，無論如何，您都應該和我們一起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我必須留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我對市民們的承諾，他們需要知道，維多利亞沒有拋棄他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們需要這份希望才能堅持下去……現在我們只能彼此信任，我們必須彼此信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，如果護航艦隊的離開只是一起誤會，或是少數人的叛變，那麼無論我在不在，“加拉瓦鐵盾”都會迎接我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果不是呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少尉的眼皮明顯顫動了一下。戴菲恩說的話，確實“大逆不道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的出現……會讓事態更糟。起碼你能活下去，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道！我並不是苟且偷生的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們放了我一次，也許是出於對我母親的尊重，也許是出於……一點惻隱之心。但他們不會給我第二次機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信任我的戰友，以及長官對公爵的忠誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，請收下我們的位置座標，我保證帶回來好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這個男人平靜地注視著我，我捏緊拳頭，防備著他猛地給我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。你的拳頭很硬，戴菲恩小姐就拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，少尉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g9_campedchariot"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，我們檢查了一遍諾伯特難民們的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道這是不是溫德米爾公爵瞞著我們下達的命令，當時登艦期間的情況太混亂，也找不到命令的執行者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就結果而言，只能說他們的登艦篩查做得非常好。如今隊伍裡的難民基本都沒有感染的跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可眼下……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看向少尉遠去的方向。\n理所當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在薩卡茲的巫術中作戰的士兵們……很多都已經有了急性的感染症狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些軍人們為了對抗薩卡茲而感染了礦石病，他們的同袍居然就這樣毫無心理負擔地拋棄他們了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這是軍隊裡的傳統。不只是維多利亞，卡西米爾、烏薩斯，乃至曾經的高盧都是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍營中不會接納感染者，也許稍微有點良心的指揮官會把他們編進獨立的編制中，然後派遣他們執行最危險的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但對於一支軍隊，感染者和他們失控的源石技藝實在是太不穩定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……總該有人反抗過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但沒有成功過。歷史上的戰爭中軍隊的感染者比例其實並不算高，為了前線的穩定，這樣的損耗是可被接受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皇家軍事學院甚至直接把這一點寫進了教材裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“榮耀基石下可敬的犧牲者們”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動粗，女士們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想和你們談談。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g9_campedchariot"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我想提前聲明一點，溫德米爾公爵閣下的死和我效忠的那部分維多利亞沒有一點關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶著哀悼而來，戴菲恩小姐，真心誠意。拋去我自己的身份，我認為她比四皇會戰中的英雄更加閃耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今，她留下的防線缺口誰來填補？她原本的戰略意義誰能替代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威靈頓公爵是個打仗的老手，但我們都知道，他並沒打算真正用出全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特公爵閣下在努力協調，她已經焦頭爛額。直白地說，溫德米爾公爵的死給我們帶來了非常非常大的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道得是不是太快了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔，這是我們的職責。您也算是……同行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟是來做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好想清楚你接下來要說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向英雄獻花，溫德米爾小姐，並且帶了一批口糧和彈藥作為禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交換什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚，殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸王之息，那根鐵條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以坦誠地告訴你，這把劍確實對我沒有用處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很喜歡交易，可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"條件很簡單——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉上你們那個該死的劍座，把那東西帶去最前線，帶去交火最密集、風暴最可能掃蕩的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們的盤算是把這把劍安穩留在後方，支起一個王公貴族們用來避暑喝茶的帳篷，那就給我滾開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你們真的願意把這東西帶到前線，為維多利亞的戰士、市民或者沒了家園的可憐人遮風避雨……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而不論他們是鐵匠的兒子還是老師的女兒，不論他們領著維多利亞的軍餉還是握著自製的武器，都能得到它的蔭庇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我大可以把這根鐵條交給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著劍座來見我，灰禮帽，在前線，我不會落後你哪怕一步，我承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哎呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這超出了我的權責範圍，我畢竟只是個代辦，最終的決定權在開斯特公爵閣下手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就去找你的主人，從我親愛的姑姑嘴裡要出個結論再來見我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下，我會去爭取的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……這只是個人的承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的談話不會被記錄。只是些私人的，不是“灰禮帽”，而是薩福克爵士，貝林厄姆的私人看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，有時候出現些新的聲音也許不是壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們已經拉攏了一些感染的戰士，呃，更多是平民啦，這……很好，但還不夠。你需要一支“軍隊”，屬於你的“軍隊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠讓他們也得以容身的軍隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這確實讓我有些驚訝。可能這本身也是開斯特的某種伎倆……\n他甚至在鼓動我建立一支整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你真的關了身上的錄音機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。關太長時間會讓我的同事們起疑惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的奶奶，在四國戰爭期間因感染被處決……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她出門前，大笑著告訴我爸，因為打仗感染礦石病的機率不到百分之三。等我繼承了爵位，去檔案館裡翻那些資料的時候，才知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個“百分之三”的統計數字，已經用了幾百年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。現代戰爭，更多的源石機械，更複雜的源石法術。但百分之三，恆久不變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也許注意不到，你們只能看到戰場的一角。公爵們也注意不到，他們的目光放得太遠太遠，但是我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞軍隊的感染問題很嚴重，從未有過的嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在之前與“文明國家”的衝突中，大家都很克制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰也不想讓自己的軍營裡滿是會爆炸的活體炸彈，或是收獲一座沾滿了源石粉末的髒城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在……我們的對手是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，如果你真的有意去做，那對你的聲望，對我的前途，對……唉，甚至對我們的國家，也許都有好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的事，我和我的同伴比你們更有數，就不勞您費心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我這裡有些廢棄的小設備，工作中的副產物，沒人要，也沒人在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為報廢品，我可以免費送給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，再會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得他有幾句真話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寧願相信，現在連他這種人也做不到在這片戰場上無動於衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他留下的是什麼？錄音和座標？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音……這是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“滋滋——”\n“需要……支援……切特雷鎮……”\n“包圍……風暴突擊隊……”\n“求援！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
